  "question": {
    "text": "The number of points on the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>54</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>135</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>70</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>180</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>210</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;at which the normal lines are parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>90</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is:"
  },
  "options": [
